flowchart LR
    U[Team member] -->|Upload project files| UP[Document upload]
    U -->|Ask a question / request analysis| PA[Project Intelligence Assistant]

    subgraph KB[Knowledge base preparation]
        UP --> DI[Document ingestion and validation]
        DI --> TX[Text extraction<br/>PDF / DOCX / CSV / TXT]
        TX --> CH[Document chunking<br/>retain source locations]
        CH --> EM[Embedding generation]
        CH --> PS[Project data store<br/>documents and processing status]
        EM --> VS[(Vector database<br/>vectors + chunk/source metadata)]
    end

    subgraph INT[Project intelligence]
        PA --> OR[Orchestrator]
        OR --> RET[RAG retrieval<br/>project/access filters]
        VS --> RET
        RET --> CTX[Ranked evidence context<br/>with citations]
        CTX --> OR
        OR --> SA[Scope and deliverable<br/>extraction agent]
        OR --> RA[Risk detection and<br/>delivery forecasting agent]
        OR --> BA[Blocker and action item<br/>identification agent]
        OR --> DA[Documentation generation agent]
        SA --> OR
        RA --> OR
        BA --> OR
        DA --> OR
        PS <--> OR
        OR --> PA
    end

    PA --> OUT[Grounded answers and recommendations]
    OR --> FIND[Validated, evidence-linked findings]
    FIND --> PS
    PS --> DR[Dashboard and reports<br/>health, risks, actions, drafts]
    FIND --> DR
    OUT --> U
    DR --> U
